{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-308",
  "title": "Multi-tenant Flow",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Multi-tenant Flow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Core Concept"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Tenant = Organization (Org)**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Admin = Org Owner**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Members = Invited Users with Roles/Permissions**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Login / Sign Up Flow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A. New User (Creating a New Org)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Sign Up Page**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Email"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Password"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Optional: Name"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Create Organization**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Org name"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Optional: Domain restriction (e.g. `@company.com`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Default Role**: User becomes **Admin/Owner** of the new Org."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "B. Existing User (Login)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Login Page**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Email + Password (or SSO)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Tenant Resolution**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If user belongs to multiple orgs: show org picker."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If one org: redirect to org dashboard."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Invitation Flow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A. Admin Invites a Member"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Navigate to **Org > Members**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Click **Invite User**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Enter email"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Assign role (e.g. Viewer, Editor, Admin)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. User receives **email invitation** with sign-up link."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "B. Invited User Flow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Clicks invite link"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Signs up / logs in"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Is automatically added to the inviting Org with assigned role"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Member Management (Admin Only)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Change Role**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Admin can promote/demote members (e.g., Editor → Viewer)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Remove Member**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Removes access to the Org, retains account for other orgs (if any)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Role & Permission Model (Simplified)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Role | Can View | Can Edit | Can Invite | Can Remove | Org Settings |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Viewer | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Editor | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Admin | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Switching Orgs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Users can switch between orgs they’re part of via:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Org picker menu"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Persistent session scoped to current org"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}